        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can fling a portion of your magic at foes. You gain a ranged unarmed attack in the sling weapon group with a maximum range of 20 feet that deals 1d4 damage. The damage type and name of the unarmed attack depend on your heritage, described below; most sprite heritages not presented in this book also use luminous spark.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Dijiang</strong> primordial pulse (spirit)</p></li><li><p><strong>Draxie</strong> euphoric spark (mental)</p></li><li><p><strong>Firefly or Murxie</strong> luminous spark (fire)</p></li><li><p><strong>Gandharva</strong> celestial song (sonic)</p></li><li><p><strong>Kanchil</strong> puzzling bolt (mental)</p></li><li><p><strong>Kaztili</strong> cruel word (sonic)</p></li><li><p><strong>Kirakor</strong> sour note (sonic)</p></li><li><p><strong>Leungli</strong> surging splash (mental)</p></li><li><p><strong>Melixie</strong> sting shot (poison)</p></li><li><p><strong>Nyktera</strong> ultrasonic pulse (sonic)</p></li><li><p><strong>Pixie</strong> pixie dust (mental)</p></li><li><p><strong>Veredram</strong> thorny barb (piercing)</p>\n</li></ul>"
        },
